# What EAS uploads when building the mobile app (mobile/). When this file exists, EAS
# uses it instead of .gitignore, so everything that must stay out is listed here.
# Only mobile/ is sent. The website, its .env files, e2e logins and Supabase files are not.

/*
!/mobile/

# Inside mobile/: generated and local-only files stay out.
/mobile/node_modules/
/mobile/.expo/
/mobile/dist/
/mobile/web-build/
/mobile/android/
/mobile/ios/
/mobile/coverage/
/mobile/src/
/mobile/.env.*
!/mobile/.env.example
/mobile/*.apk
/mobile/*.aab
/mobile/*.jks
/mobile/*.p8
/mobile/*.p12
/mobile/*.key
/mobile/*.pem

# These two are ignored by git but ARE uploaded: the build needs them and neither is secret.
#   mobile/.env                  Supabase address and publishable key
#   mobile/google-services.json  Firebase config for Android push
